{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_07",
  "title": "龜裂",
  "storyCode": "DM-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a05cabc39e3649b0105313aaea7fd694e6926a9fe098ea4419119387af29a892",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......我對你有印象......同胞。我們在戰場上見過面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唉，唉。你不該來切爾諾伯格，羅德島的資訊已經分發給了全隊。你和你的部下都會死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，即使你們如此優秀，還是不應該如此輕易地穿過W負責的防線，除非......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這麼說來，她還是做出了這個選擇。其實我們都有預料到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你們中有人曾和我們並肩作戰。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "這是我們還在戰場上談話的唯一理由。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......特蕾西婭是個卓越的領袖，她改變了很多人對這片大地的看法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "理想化的看法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不用急著反駁，我比你更清楚卡茲戴爾所面臨的殘酷，我並不想否定她，但比起一個偉大的過程，我只想要一個微不足道的結果。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "只有如今攝政王的手腕能為薩卡茲帶來新的未來，絕不是氾濫的善意。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們本可以試著攜手共進，至少不用同歸於盡。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "愚蠢的想法，薩卡茲綿長的憤懣如何安放？長久以來的傾斜如何扶正？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "未感染者，烏薩斯。感染者，整合運動。薩卡茲，卡茲戴爾。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "都是一回事，與整合運動合作的日子裡我更加確信了這件事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "攝政王殿下能為我們開拓一個新的家園，我只是選擇追隨這個可能性。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "一如當年，你們天真地追隨特蕾西婭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......好了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "既然W把你放了進來，你一定也付出了代價。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你付出了什麼呢？為了拖延時間掩護你而喪命的部下？甚至是......你自己？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "告訴我你現在的名字吧。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "——Scout。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "很耳熟的代號，為表尊重，我本來是想把你的本名刻在這把刀上。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "雇傭兵不也都是用假名的嗎，加爾森。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵領袖",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "......你說得也對。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "放棄抵抗吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......還有你的十二位隊員，已經被確認全滅了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "雷髮，米米，圖釘，死於整合運動術師的包圍網正中，有一個是站著死的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "小瑪麗，長音，斯琳珂，長蠍佔據了一處陣線，W親自帶隊過去了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "姆拉姆，酒莓軟芯，淤蘭，和我們的一支小隊同歸於盡，有人殺出了重圍，然後被赫德雷的刀兵斬首。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "普特爾剛才死在那棟樓下，很意外，好像是為了救一個沒來得及撤出的平民。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "索拉娜還留著一口氣，被帶回去了，想必她會想方設法自盡的吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......還不吭聲嗎。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "別躲了，你聽得見，影子一清二楚，你的氣息混亂不堪，傷得不輕。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......你為什麼知道他們的名字？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "W特意囑咐過，你們會把兵牌一類的東西掛在身上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "“至少殺了誰還是要弄明白的，這裡畢竟不是卡茲戴爾，不留神殺錯人可就不好辦了”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那不是兵牌，犧牲的那些幹員們......也不全是士兵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我以為會是W來親自動手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她......哼，我要是說她不忍心親手解決你，你會信嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "攝政王派來的領袖已經被你殺了，想要接管的可不止她一個，她現在比較忙。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "就像當時你和W說好的一樣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "一旦你完成任務，我們就會“後知後覺”地全力殲滅你們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......你在巷戰的過程中還抽空救了個人。但現在，那不是我們的管轄範圍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但是愛國者在那裡，你不需要過問。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......這樣，就好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你們......變了，過去的W不是個會刻意記住死者名諱的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她確實變了，但更多時候是變得更像個瘋子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你純粹的戰地經驗就堪比浮士德的源石技藝，說不定只是為了讓你動搖，好讓我用法術捕捉你才故意記下名字的呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......老樣子，總不放過任何取樂的機會。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "彼此，你不是也接受了這種W才能想出來的瘋狂交易。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "用我的命換取一個機會，再讓該把握住這個機會的人把握住它，這並不瘋狂。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "還有我犧牲的隊員們，也一樣。他們為了自己的理念而死，沒有他們，我無法成功。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......看來時過境遷，大家都有一些變化。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你也是，過去的你絕不會像現在這樣，給敵人喘息的空間。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "赫德雷應該提醒過你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "為什麼還要抵抗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......嘖，不見了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但願你能就這麼逃掉......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（這個方向嗎？）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（沒錯，這裡。動作真快。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（麻煩的傢伙，如果他沒有受傷，恐怕我連他人都見不著......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（等等。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（他......他在向核心城轉移？）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（那裡——嘖！）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......該死！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "已經這麼靠近核心城了，你到底想幹什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "老老實實離開切爾諾伯格不行嗎！？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......你有時候真不像是個薩卡茲，伊內絲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我本來就不是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——你該繼續裝下去的，你是個薩卡茲雇傭兵，而這裡是戰場。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "現在你跑不動了，失血過多，頭暈，四肢發冷，除了你的影子像是要燒起來一樣，你不應該還能站著。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我的傷，我自己有數，何況這裡還有那麼多的整合運動。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "而對你們......你，赫德雷，還有W......我有一個建議。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......念在殿下的份上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "用你的眼睛看清真相，在那之前不要白白死去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們......薩卡茲不該這樣繼續被人利用了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你在說法術？這裡能看到什——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "————"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——這是......這......這是誰......這種......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
          "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
          "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
          "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
          "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
          "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
          "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
          "text": "......薩卡茲？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不可能，被察覺到了——！？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（機會——！）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "很久不見了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "唔......你？你原來......還活著。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我一直在跟著你，只靠伊內絲，很難對付你這樣的高手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "雖然交易內容就是要付出性命，我們也沒打算手下留情，但我還是希望你能......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可現在我們已經不能給你更多機會了，這裡太過靠近核心城了，W不希望任何人的注意力轉移到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呵......聽上去......現在她才是隊長了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你......原來......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......抱歉。睡吧，老朋友。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你們......不該繼續待在這裡......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......我知道的，老朋友。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我一直都知道的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "赫德雷！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你剛才動搖了，為什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——快走！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們必須馬上通知W，必須——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嘖！她靠近了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塔露拉",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
